      \u0022The answer of problem 1\u0022, \/\/ \u53cc\u5f15\u53f7\u4e2d\u66ff\u6362\u4e3a \u8bd5\u9898 1 \u7684\u7b54\u6848\n        \u0022The answer of problem 2\u0022, \/\/ \u53cc\u5f15\u53f7\u4e2d\u66ff\u6362\u4e3a \u8bd5\u9898 2 \u7684\u7b54\u6848\n        \u0022The answer of problem 3\u0022, \/\/ \u53cc\u5f15\u53f7\u4e2d\u66ff\u6362\u4e3a \u8bd5\u9898 3 \u7684\u7b54\u6848\n        \u0022The answer of problem 4\u0022, \/\/ \u53cc\u5f15\u53f7\u4e2d\u66ff\u6362\u4e3a \u8bd5\u9898 4 \u7684\u7b54\u6848\n        \u0022The answer of problem 5\u0022, \/\/ \u53cc\u5f15\u53f7\u4e2d\u66ff\u6362\u4e3a \u8bd5\u9898 5 \u7684\u7b54\u6848\n    };\n    int T;\n    cin \u003E\u003E T;\n    cout \u003C\u003C ans[T - 1] \u003C\u003C endl;\n    return 0;\n}\n```","locale":"zh-CN"}},"bookmarked":false,"contest":null,"contestProblems":null,"contestOrigin":null,"vjudgeUsername":null,"lastLanguage":null,"lastCode":"","lastCodeAt":null,"recommendations":[],"forum":{"name":"B3705 [\u8bed\u8a00\u6708\u8d5b202302] \u542c\u89c1\u4e0b\u96e8\u7684\u58f0\u97f3","type":2,"slug":"B3705","color":"orange-3"},"discussions":[{"id":1088573,"title":"B3705 [\u8bed\u8a00\u6708\u8d5b202302] \u542c\u89c1\u4e0b\u96e8\u7684\u58f0\u97f3\u7b2c4\u4e2a\u7b54\u6848\u662f\u4ec0\u4e48\uff1f\u8c22\u8c22","author":{"uid":1356470,"avatar":"https:\/\/cdn.luogu.com.cn\/upload\/usericon\/1356470.png","name":"xiaoniao2024","slogan":"\u8c01\u8c13\u6cb3\u5e7f\uff0c\u4e00\u82c7\u676d\u4e4b||\u4e0d\u62ff\u84dd\u52fe\u4e0d\u6539\u7b7e||team102621","badge":null,"isAdmin":false,"isBanned":false,"color":"Red","ccfLevel":0,"xcpcLevel":0,"background":"https:\/\/cdn.luogu.com.cn\/upload\/image_hosting\/dk9d1owq.png"},"time":1748669612},{"id":1054156,"title":"\u8fdb\u98df\u540e\u5165","author":{"uid":1492895,"avatar":"https:\/\/cdn.luogu.com.cn\/upload\/usericon\/1492895.png","name":"ztk110929525j26","slogan":"\u8fd9\u4e2a\u5bb6\u4f19\u5f88sao","badge":null,"isAdmin":false,"isBanned":false,"color":"Blue","ccfLevel":0,"xcpcLevel":0,